[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499157208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99663#issuecomment-2499157208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99663","id":2499157208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U9hzY","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T22:22:29Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T22:26:00Z","body":"Tested the MRP on v4.4.dev5.official [9e6098432], Windows 10. The converted shader material does indeed look different:\nStandardMaterial:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6c1ee00-6715-4edc-9ac9-5ae352c64869)\nShaderMaterial:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3e77d2a-8f48-4aaa-970a-11b10558d838)\n\nAlso reproducible in 4.3.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499157208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502652105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99663#issuecomment-2502652105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99663","id":2502652105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VK3DJ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T03:47:55Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T03:47:55Z","body":"In the past when we have had issues like this it has come from the shader parameters getting lost in translation. Can one of you check and see if the shader parameters of the new ShaderMaterial look correct?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502652105/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502673252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99663#issuecomment-2502673252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99663","id":2502673252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VK8Nk","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T04:02:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T04:06:52Z","body":"I think it's from the generated shader's `refraction_texture_channel` being set to a default of `vec4(0.0)`:\n```glsl\nuniform vec4 refraction_texture_channel;\n```\nIf you set one or more of the channels to `1.0`, refraction returns. The other parameters **mostly** seem to transfer correctly, but the converted shader also appears to be a different color.\n\n---\n\nI duplicated the material in the filesystem, then converted with the filesystem `Convert to ShaderMaterial` context menu action that was recently added, if it makes a difference. \n\nOriginal shader, text format:\n```\n[gd_resource type=\"StandardMaterial3D\" load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://dun46tju52s24\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" uid=\"uid://bqyhvb4qj0rbe\" path=\"res://Textures/Water/Water_Normal.png\" id=\"1_lho8h\"]\n\n[resource]\ntransparency = 1\ncull_mode = 2\ndepth_draw_mode = 1\nalbedo_color = Color(0.431373, 0.635294, 0.87451, 0.705882)\nmetallic = 0.98\nroughness = 0.02\nnormal_enabled = true\nnormal_scale = 0.05\nnormal_texture = ExtResource(\"1_lho8h\")\nrefraction_enabled = true\nrefraction_scale = 0.1\nrefraction_texture = ExtResource(\"1_lho8h\")\nrefraction_texture_channel = 4\nuv1_scale = Vector3(15, 15, 15)\ntexture_filter = 5\nproximity_fade_enabled = true\nproximity_fade_distance = 0.5\n```\n\nConverted shader parameters:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53615ab1-d434-4a67-a7a5-841511db7afc)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502673252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502790550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99663#issuecomment-2502790550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99663","id":2502790550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VLY2W","user":{"login":"Jamsers","id":39361911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzYxOTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39361911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers","html_url":"https://github.com/Jamsers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T05:05:05Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T05:05:05Z","body":"I can confirm that setting Metallic Texture Channel and Refraction Texture Channel x values to 1.0 makes the converted GDShader look similar to its source StandardMaterial3D (at least to my eyes). I think this is just [#84633](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84633), but for refraction as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502790550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]